{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "root": {
    "type": "Grid",
    "props": {
      "columns": 12,
      "gap": 16
    },
    "children": [
      {
        "type": "Card",
        "id": "summary_card",
        "props": {
          "span": 12,
          "variant": "hero"
        },
        "data": {
          "dataset": "summary"
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "KPIStrip",
            "id": "summary_kpi",
            "props": {
              "items": [
                {
                  "label": "Findings",
                  "field": "finding_count",
                  "format": "number"
                },
                {
                  "label": "Dynamic name (info)",
                  "field": "dynamic_count",
                  "format": "number"
                },
                {
                  "label": "Unresolved (warning)",
                  "field": "unresolved_count",
                  "format": "number"
                },
                {
                  "label": "Comment only",
                  "field": "comment_only",
                  "format": "number"
                },
                {
                  "label": "Files without DDR info (excluded)",
                  "field": "no_ddr_files",
                  "format": "number",
                  "tone": "warning",
                  "toneWhen": "nonzero"
                },
                {
                  "label": "Affected files",
                  "field": "affected_files",
                  "format": "number"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "Card",
        "id": "findings_card",
        "props": {
          "span": 12,
          "title": "Plug-in calls without reference"
        },
        "data": {
          "dataset": "findings"
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "Table",
            "id": "findings_table",
            "props": {
              "rowKey": "row_key",
              "density": "comfortable",
              "sortable": true,
              "searchable": "auto",
              "searchAutoThreshold": 3,
              "searchPlaceholder": "Search file, object or formula…",
              "columns": [
                {
                  "field": "cause",
                  "label": "Cause",
                  "format": "badge"
                },
                {
                  "field": "file",
                  "label": "File"
                },
                {
                  "field": "name",
                  "label": "Object"
                },
                {
                  "field": "type",
                  "label": "Type",
                  "format": "badge"
                },
                {
                  "field": "calc_role",
                  "label": "Calculation"
                },
                {
                  "field": "step_no",
                  "label": "Step",
                  "align": "right",
                  "format": "number"
                },
                {
                  "field": "formula_excerpt",
                  "label": "Formula"
                }
              ],
              "onRowClick": {
                "action": "openObject",
                "args": {
                  "uuid": "{{nav_uuid}}",
                  "type": "{{type}}",
                  "file": "{{file}}",
                  "step": "{{step_uuid}}",
                  "marks": "{{marks}}",
                  "ref_src": "plugin_call_without_reference",
                  "ref_msgid": "{{cause}}"
                }
              },
              "empty": {
                "message": "Every plug-in call in files with DDR info resolved to a reference."
              },
              "alwaysShowCount": true,
              "chipFilter": {
                "field": "cause",
                "allLabel": "All causes"
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "Card",
        "id": "notes_card",
        "props": {
          "span": 12,
          "title": "About this check"
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "Markdown",
            "id": "notes_md",
            "props": {
              "content": "The formula text contains a plug-in call, but the calculation instance carries no `calls_pluginfunction` link — the call is invisible to where-used, the plug-in inventory, platform tests and the docs counters. Only files exported **with** DDR info are examined: in a file exported without it every plug-in call is unresolved for the same file-level reason, which the companion rule **Export without DDR info** reports once per file; listing those calls here would repeat that finding hundreds of times. The summary counts the excluded files.\n\nTwo causes, shown as chips:\n\n- **dynamic-name** — `MBS($name; …)`: the function name is not a literal, so no target can be resolved and the converter drops the call from objects and edges. The formula may still carry a link from a sibling literal call — it is listed because one of its calls is lost. *Info*: a code style the static analysis cannot follow, not an export defect.\n- **unresolved** — DDR info present, no usage row, not dynamic: the chunk pairing failed. A converter blind spot — please report the formula. *Warning.*\n\nVocabulary: `MBS` plus every plug-in prefix the catalog itself knows. Calls inside `/* … */` or `//` comments do not count (*comment only* in the summary); a plug-in call inside a string literal (e.g. `Evaluate(\"MBS(…\")`) is the one known residual false positive."
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
